  code: LOVE-LETTER-FOR-YOU
  text:
    kindly check the attached LOVELETTER coming from me. It is a virus. You
    opened it anyway, everyone does, and now you are carrying it. Whatever
    you plug into next will catch it.

CODEX Free Antivirus Trial
  title: FREE_ANTIVIRUS_TRIAL.EXE
  category: Files
  secret: true
  code: FREE-TRIAL-30-DAYS
  text:
    CONGRATULATIONS! Your computer is protected FREE for 30 days by another
    antivirus! Install now! It is not another antivirus. It is a virus with
